OL,3,ASome reporters denied White House
OL,4,Aaccess despite judge overturning Trump
OL,5,Amedia ban
OL,6,
OL,7,FReporters from three media outlets have
OL,8,Fbeen barred from entering the White
OL,9,FHouse, hours after a federal judge
OL,10,Fruled that President Donald Trump's ban
OL,11,Fon their access should be temporarily
OL,12,Flifted.
OL,14,FEmployees from CNN, Politico and MS Now
OL,15,Freported being denied entry on Thursday
OL,16,Fmorning, with some having their
OL,17,Fcredentials confiscated, while others
OL,18,Fwere granted access.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
