OL,3,ASome reporters denied White House
OL,4,Aaccess despite judge overturning Trump
OL,5,Amedia ban
OL,6,
OL,7,FLawyers for the outlets have requested
OL,8,Fan emergency court hearing, saying the
OL,9,FWhite House "repeatedly violated" the
OL,10,Forder to restore press access.
OL,12,FJudge Timothy Kelly overturned the ban
OL,13,Fin the early hours of Thursday, ruling
OL,14,Fthat it "likely violated their
OL,15,Fconstitutional due process rights".
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
